# Development environment.
#
# The value below is a relative path served by the Vite dev proxy declared in
# vite.config.ts, which forwards /api to https://threatpulse.iliadis.net.
# Proxying is required during development: publications.php returns no CORS
# headers, so a direct cross-origin browser call would be blocked.
#
# An absolute URL is also supported, for example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://threatpulse.iliadis.net/api/cti/v1/
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/cti/v1/
